ry":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 53.8%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.67"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":284.17,"default_fair_val":284.17,"premium_pct":5,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":27.3,"pe_forward":24,"pb_trailing":6.1,"pb_forward":5.5,"div_yield":5.17,"ps_ratio":4.4,"fcf_to_ev":4.85,"fcf_to_mcap":5.71,"liab_to_assets":53.8,"cash_to_assets":1.3,"current_ratio":0.67,"roe":22.2,"roa":10.2,"moat":{"ticker":"PSA","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Public Storage 品牌在自助倉儲業中具有極高的辨識度和信譽，這使其在定價上擁有一定的優勢。消費者傾向於選擇知名品牌，即使價格略高。這種品牌忠誠度是其核心競爭力之一，尤其是在市場飽和時，品牌價值能有效區隔競爭對手。然而，倉儲服務本質上仍具備一定的商品化屬性，價格彈性相對有限，因此品牌定價權並非絕對。","comment_en":"Public Storage boasts significant brand recognition and trust within the self-storage industry, affording it a degree of pricing power. Consumers often gravitate towards established brands, even at a slight premium. This brand loyalty is a key competitive advantage, particularly in saturated markets where brand equity helps differentiate from competitors. However, the inherent commoditized nature of storage services limits absolute pricing flexibility, thus the pricing power is not absolute."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":1,"comment_zh":"自助倉儲行業的進入壁壘主要來自於土地取得、開發成本和規模，而非專利或特許經營權。Public Storage 的業務模式不依賴於受專利保護的技術或獨家政府許可，這意味著其競爭優勢不來自於此類受保護的無形資產。因此，在專利和監管壁壘方面，該公司得分極低。","comment_en":"The self-storage industry's barriers to entry are primarily rooted in land acquisition, development costs, and scale, rather than patents or regulatory licenses. Public Storage's business model does not rely on patented technology or exclusive government permits, meaning its competitive advantage does not stem from such protected intangible assets. Consequently, the company scores very low on patent and regulatory barriers."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"客戶轉換到其他倉儲服務的成本相對較高，主要體現在搬運物品的體力勞動、時間成本以及潛在的物品損壞風險。一旦客戶將物品存放在 Public Storage，並建立起習慣性的使用模式，更換供應商的麻煩程度會促使他們維持現狀。儘管不是絕對的鎖定，但這種操作上的不便構成了有效的轉換壁壘。","comment_en":"The costs for customers to switch to other storage services are relatively high, primarily involving the physical effort of moving items, time investment, and the potential risk of damage. Once a customer stores their belongings with Public Storage and establishes a routine, the hassle of changing providers encourages them to stay. While not an absolute lock-in, this operational inconvenience forms an effective switching barrier."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"自助倉儲業的網絡效應非常有限。雖然 Public Storage 擁有廣泛的地理佈局，但單一儲存單元的使用者體驗與其他使用者之間幾乎沒有直接的互動或依賴。其網絡效應更多體現在品牌覆蓋和規模優勢上，而非傳統意義上由用戶增長帶來的價值遞增。因此，在此維度上得分較低。","comment_en":"Network effects in the self-storage industry are very limited. Although Public Storage has an extensive geographic footprint, the user experience of a single storage unit has almost no direct interaction or dependency on other users. Its network effects are more evident in brand coverage and scale advantages rather than the value accretion typically driven by user growth in traditional network effect models. Therefore, the score in this dimension is low."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Public Storage 作為行業領導者，其龐大的規模帶來了顯著的成本優勢。這包括在土地收購、建設、營銷、管理和融資方面的規模經濟。其廣泛的物業組合使其能夠更有效地分散固定成本，並在採購和運營中獲得更好的議價能力。這種規模帶來的成本效率是其難以被小型競爭者複製的關鍵壁壘。","comment_en":"As an industry leader, Public Storage's immense scale provides significant cost advantages. This includes economies of scale in land acquisition, construction, marketing, management, and financing. Its vast portfolio allows for more effective spreading of fixed costs and better bargaining power in procurement and operations. This scale-driven cost efficiency is a critical barrier that smaller competitors find difficult to replicate."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Public Storage 在美國主要都會區擁有大量優質的儲存設施，這些地點通常位於交通便利、人口稠密的區域，是其核心資產。獲取這些黃金地段的土地成本極高，且難以複製。這種地理位置的優勢，特別是在需求旺盛的市場，構成了強大的競爭壁壘，使公司能夠維持較高的出租率和租金水平。","comment_en":"Public Storage possesses a substantial portfolio of prime storage facilities in major US metropolitan areas. These locations are typically in accessible, densely populated areas, forming its core assets. The cost and difficulty of acquiring these prime land parcels are extremely high and hard to replicate. This locational advantage, especially in high-demand markets, constitutes a strong competitive barrier, enabling the company to maintain high occupancy rates and rental prices."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Public Storage 在運營效率方面表現出色，其標準化的服務流程、先進的技術應用（如在線預訂和管理系統）以及精細化的物業管理，都極大地提高了運營效率和客戶體驗。公司能夠以較低的單位成本管理龐大的資產組合，這得益於其成熟的管理體系和持續的流程優化。這種高效的運營能力是其盈利能力的關鍵。","comment_en":"Public Storage excels in operational efficiency. Its standardized service processes, advanced technology applications (like online booking and management systems), and meticulous property management significantly enhance operational efficiency and customer experience. The company can manage its vast asset portfolio at a lower per-unit cost, thanks to its mature management systems and continuous process optimization. This efficient operational capability is key to its profitability."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Public Storage 在資本配置方面展現出穩健的記錄，尤其是在 REIT 結構下，其對股息的重視以及對增長性項目的審慎投資。公司在擴張、收購和回購之間取得平衡，並有效利用債務融資來優化資本結構。雖然其增長策略相對保守，但這種對資本的審慎運用有助於維持穩定的股東回報和資產價值。","comment_en":"Public Storage demonstrates a solid track record in capital allocation, particularly under its REIT structure, emphasizing dividends while prudently investing in growth projects. The company balances expansion, acquisitions, and share repurchases, effectively utilizing debt financing to optimize its capital structure. While its growth strategy is relatively conservative, this prudent use of capital helps maintain stable shareholder returns and asset value."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"如 M3 所述，客戶轉換成本是 Public Storage 維持客戶忠誠度的關鍵。加上其廣泛的網絡和可靠的品牌聲譽，使得客戶一旦選擇便傾向於長期使用。公司通過提供一致的服務質量和便利性來鞏固客戶關係。雖然沒有傳統 SaaS 產品的強網絡效應，但其服務的穩定性和便利性有效提高了客戶留存率。","comment_en":"As noted in M3, customer switching costs are key to Public Storage's customer retention. Coupled with its extensive network and reliable brand reputation, customers tend to use its services long-term once chosen. The company solidifies customer relationships by providing consistent service quality and convenience. While lacking the strong network effects of traditional SaaS products, the stability and convenience of its services effectively enhance customer retention rates."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"自助倉儲行業具有顯著的持久性。其服務需求相對穩定，不易受經濟週期劇烈波動影響，因為人們在經濟下行時可能需要儲存更多物品，而在經濟上行時則可能搬家或擴大居住空間。Public Storage 的商業模式具有低資本支出（相對於其他重資產行業）和穩定的現金流特性，使其能夠在長期內抵禦經濟波動，展現出強大的業務韌性。","comment_en":"The self-storage industry exhibits significant durability. Demand for its services is relatively stable and less susceptible to severe economic cycle fluctuations, as people may need to store more items during downturns and move or expand living spaces during upturns. Public Storage's business model features low capital expenditures (relative to other heavy asset industries) and stable cash flows, enabling it to withstand economic volatility over the long term and demonstrate strong business resilience."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Public Storage 的護城河主要體現為一個強大的『收費橋』模式，其核心壁壘來自於龐大的規模經濟（M5）和遍佈優質地段的稀缺資產（M6）。客戶因搬運物品的不便而產生的轉換成本（M3, M9）以及公司卓越的運營效率（M7）共同構成了其穩固的競爭優勢。雖然品牌（M1）和管理層的資本配置（M8）也提供支持，但其護城河的強度主要依賴於實物資產的規模和地理位置，而非專利或網絡效應。整體而言，這是一個由規模、地點和客戶慣性構築的堅實護城河。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Public Storage operates a strong 'toll bridge' economic moat, primarily built on immense economies of scale (M5) and scarce, well-located assets (M6). Customer switching costs due to the inconvenience of moving (M3, M9), combined with excellent operational efficiency (M7), form its solid competitive advantage. While brand (M1) and capital allocation (M8) provide support, the moat's strength relies heavily on the scale and location of physical assets rather than patents or network effects. Overall, it's a robust moat constructed from scale, location, and customer inertia.","evidenceHash":"5cbe88ddccddedf3dcfb1757668447ffd63d5331ee79ef7f47ab13b1791aa292","assessmentPolicy":"us-buffett-moat-v3"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":8,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"safe","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"7e5740d2156d6d7ed38307d6e47cb7b0a5d8e8c9fad8aa70975072c43c63d0b3"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2024-12-31","period":"FY 2024","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-28T14:40:26.418Z","evidenceHash":"7e5740d2156d6d7ed38307d6e47cb7b0a5d8e8c9fad8aa70975072c43c63d0b3"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/PSA.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/PSA.png","website":"https://www.publicstorage.com","ceo":"H. Thomas Boyle","full_time_employees":"5770","description":"Public Storage (PSA), an esteemed Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT) and a constituent of both the S&P 500 and FT Global 500 indices, concentrates its operations on the acquisition, development, ownership, and management of self-storage properties. By September 30, 2020, the company's substantial holdings included 2,504 self-storage facilities located across 38 U.S. states, collectively providing around 171 million net rentable square feet. Additionally, Public Storage held an approximate 35% common equity interest in Shurgard Self Storage SA (Euronext Brussels:SHUR), an entity that owned and operated 239 self-storage sites under the Shurgard brand in seven Western European countries, encompassing approximately 13 million net rentable square feet. Concurrently, it maintained an approximate 42% common equity interest in PS Business Parks, Inc. (NYSE:PSB), which, as of the same reporting date, managed roughly 28 million rentable square feet of commercial properties. The company's main office is situated in Glendale, California.","description_en":"Public Storage (PSA), an esteemed Real Estate Investment Trust (REIT) and a constituent of both the S&P 500 and FT Global 500 indices, concentrates its operations on the acquisition, development, ownership, and management of self-storage properties. By September 30, 2020, the company's substantial holdings included 2,504 self-storage facilities located across 38 U.S. states, collectively providing around 171 million net rentable square feet. Additionally, Public Storage held an approximate 35% common equity interest in Shurgard Self Storage SA (Euronext Brussels:SHUR), an entity that owned and operated 239 self-storage sites under the Shurgard brand in seven Western European countries, encompassing approximately 13 million net rentable square feet. Concurrently, it maintained an approximate 42% common equity interest in PS Business Parks, Inc. (NYSE:PSB), which, as of the same reporting date, managed roughly 28 million rentable square feet of commercial properties. The company's main office is situated in Glendale, California.","description_zh":"**Public Storage (PSA) 業務營運分析**\n\nPublic Storage (PSA) 是一家領先的房地產投資信託基金 (REIT)，專注於自儲存設施的收購、開發、持有與管理。截至 2020 年 9 月 30 日，該公司於美國 38 個州擁有 2,504 個自儲存據點，總計約 1.71 億平方英尺的可出租淨面積。\n\n此外，PSA 持有 Shurgard Self Storage SA (Euronext Brussels: SHUR) 約 35% 的普通股權益，Shurgard 在歐洲七國營運 239 個自儲存據點，總計約 1,300 萬平方英尺的可出租淨面積。同時，PSA 也持有 PS Business Parks, Inc. (NYSE: PSB) 約 42% 的普通股權益，該公司管理約 2,800 萬平方英尺的商業地產。\n\nPSA 的核心業務模式為提供個人及企業客戶安全、便利的儲存解決方案，透過其龐大的實體網絡及高效的營運管理，滿足市場對儲存空間日益增長的需求。公司總部位於加州格倫代爾。","address":"2811 Internet Boulevard","city":"Frisco","state":"TX","zip":"75034","country":"US","phone":"818-244-8080","full_address":"2811 Internet Boulevard, Frisco, TX 75034, US","range_52w":"256.54-335.55","year_high":335.55,"year_low":256.54,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":256.54,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-07","name":"SPOGLI RONALD P","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":6,"price":285.85,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-07","name":"HAVNER RONALD L JR","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":4,"price":285.85,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"PETHERBRIDGE LUKE J","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":151,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"Mitra Shankh","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":339,"price":282.84,"total_val":0.1},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"WILLIAMS PAUL S","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":52,"price":282.84,"total_val":0.01},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"SPOGLI RONALD P","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":151,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-10-02","name":"HAVNER RONALD L JR","title":"director","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":107,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-09-03","name":"Sheek Samuel Wade","title":"officer: Chief Legal Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"A-Award","shares":6213,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-18","name":"Sheek Samuel Wade","title":"officer","is_buy":null,"action":"","shares":0,"price":0,"total_val":0},{"date":"2026-08-14","name":"Vitan Nathaniel A.","title":"officer: Chief Legal Officer","is_buy":fals